{"message":"I verified your identity and checked your referral records. I found 15 referrals, including 8 marked COMPLETE and one Silver Rewards Card referral marked IN_PROGRESS from 11/13/2025. I couldn’t locate a posted referral-credit transaction in the available account records.

For the Silver Rewards Card, your friend must spend at least $750 within 60 days of account opening; the $75 bonus generally posts within one to two billing cycles after that requirement is met. Approval and card use alone do not trigger the bonus. Platinum Rewards requires $1,500 in spending within 90 days, while the qualifying requirement varies for other cards.

If you’re referring to the 11/13 Silver referral, it is still pending the qualifying-spend requirement or processing. If you meant a different friend, please tell me the card type and approximate referral date so I can identify the correct record."}
